            },
            {
              "text": "Whenever she saw someone who lacked food, she gave them whatever she had in her hands.",
              "audioStart": 46.825,
              "audioEnd": 51.163
            },
            {
              "text": "Her gentle nature made her well known among the local residents who respected her greatly.",
              "audioStart": 52.025,
              "audioEnd": 56.438
            },
            {
              "text": "Although she had very little, her giving spirit was larger than any house in the city.",
              "audioStart": 57.3,
              "audioEnd": 61.75
            },
            {
              "text": "She believed that being good to others mattered more than having wealth or possessions.",
              "audioStart": 62.612,
              "audioEnd": 66.575
            },
            {
              "text": "Her parents had taught her to be nice before they passed away from this life.",
              "audioStart": 67.438,
              "audioEnd": 71.225
            },
            {
              "text": "She remembered their words every time she made a decision to help a stranger.",
              "audioStart": 72.088,
              "audioEnd": 75.838
            },
            {
              "text": "Day after day, she continued this wonderful habit without showing any sign of sadness.",
              "audioStart": 76.7,
              "audioEnd": 81.638
            },
            {
              "text": "She felt happy whenever she brought a smile to the face of a tired person.",
              "audioStart": 82.5,
              "audioEnd": 86.325
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing could stop her from doing good acts because her spirit was strong and pure.",
              "audioStart": 87.188,
              "audioEnd": 91.237
            },
            {
              "text": "She lived through many difficult months, yet her warm care remained constant and true.",
              "audioStart": 92.1,
              "audioEnd": 96.475
            },
            {
              "text": "People often wondered how she managed to survive with such a giving and open heart.",
              "audioStart": 97.338,
              "audioEnd": 101.475
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "One day, the good child walked out into a field alone, because she had no home left.",
              "audioStart": 102.338,
              "audioEnd": 107.125
            },
            {
              "text": "An old man met her on the road and asked her for something to eat.",
              "audioStart": 107.987,
              "audioEnd": 111.263
            },
            {
              "text": "She gave him her last bit of food without any pause, wishing that she could help him more.",
              "audioStart": 112.125,
              "audioEnd": 116.662
            },
            {
              "text": "The old man thanked her with a warm smile and walked away into the distance.",
              "audioStart": 117.525,
              "audioEnd": 121.275
            },
            {
              "text": "She stood there for a moment and felt glad that the old man had food now.",
              "audioStart": 122.138,
              "audioEnd": 125.7
            },
            {
              "text": "Soon after that, she met a little boy who was crying because his head was cold.",
              "audioStart": 126.562,
              "audioEnd": 130.713
            },
            {
              "text": "She took off her coat and gave it to him, so that he would feel warm.",
              "audioStart": 131.575,
              "audioEnd": 134.925
            },
            {
              "text": "The boy put on the coat and stopped crying immediately as the cold wind left him.",
              "audioStart": 135.787,
              "audioEnd": 139.8
            },
            {
              "text": "She smiled at the child and watched him run off to play with his friends.",
              "audioStart": 140.662,
              "audioEnd": 144.213
            },
            {
              "text": "A little further down the path, another child asked for her dress.",
              "audioStart": 145.075,
              "audioEnd": 148.825
            },
            {
              "text": "Without thinking twice, she gave that away too and remained with very few clothes.",
              "audioStart": 149.688,
              "audioEnd": 154.137
            },
            {
              "text": "She did not care about the cold wind that began to blow across the open field.",
              "audioStart": 155,
              "audioEnd": 158.875
            },
            {
              "text": "Her mind was at peace because she had made three children feel safe and happy.",
              "audioStart": 159.738,
              "audioEnd": 163.588
            },
            {
              "text": "She continued walking down the long road as the afternoon turned into evening.",
              "audioStart": 164.45,
              "audioEnd": 168.45
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun went down behind the hills, and the shadows grew longer across the ground.",
              "audioStart": 169.312,
              "audioEnd": 173.562
            },
            {
              "text": "She knew that she would have to spend the night outside under the open sky.",
              "audioStart": 174.425,
              "audioEnd": 177.775
            },
            {
              "text": "She was not afraid of the dark because she had done nothing wrong in her life.",
              "audioStart": 178.637,
              "audioEnd": 182.363
            },
            {
              "text": "Her gentle actions gave her the strength to keep moving forward despite everything.",
              "audioStart": 183.225,
              "audioEnd": 187.363
            },
            {
              "text": "She trusted that something good would happen to her before the morning came.",
              "audioStart": 188.225,
              "audioEnd": 191.7
            },
            {
              "text": "Her belief in doing good kept her going when the path became hard to see.",
              "audioStart": 192.562,
              "audioEnd": 196.188
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "When night came, she found herself in a dark forest with no clothes and no food left.",
              "audioStart": 197.05,
              "audioEnd": 201.963
            },
            {
              "text": "Suddenly, stars began to fall down from the sky above her like bright silver money.",
              "audioStart": 202.825,
              "audioEnd": 207.137
            },
            {
              "text": "She looked up and saw that the stars were turning into fine new clothes.",
              "audioStart": 208,
              "audioEnd": 211.475
            },
            {
              "text": "The clothes landed softly around her on the dark ground of the quiet forest.",
              "audioStart": 212.338,
              "audioEnd": 216.238
            },
            {
              "text": "The happy girl quickly gathered up the wonderful gifts which had been sent from above.",
              "audioStart": 217.1,
              "audioEnd": 221.325
            },
            {
              "text": "She put on the finest clothes and became a rich person who could help everyone.",
              "audioStart": 222.188,
              "audioEnd": 226.1
            },
            {
              "text": "From that day forward, she lived a good life and was never poor again.",
              "audioStart": 226.963,
              "audioEnd": 230.637
            },
            {
              "text": "She used her new wealth to build a large house where poor people could stay.",
              "audioStart": 231.5,
              "audioEnd": 235.025
            },
            {
              "text": "Many individuals came to her door, and she welcomed every single one of them inside.",
              "audioStart": 235.887,
              "audioEnd": 240.438
            },
            {
              "text": "She provided them with warm food, clean clothes, and a safe place to sleep.",
              "audioStart": 241.3,
              "audioEnd": 245.65
            },
            {
              "text": "Her name became famous throughout the country as a symbol of true love.",
              "audioStart": 246.512,
              "audioEnd": 251.266
            },
            {
              "text": "Children and adults together visited her home to share their stories and seek advice.",
              "audioStart": 252.129,
              "audioEnd": 256.441
            },
            {
              "text": "She listened to everyone with calm strength and gave them the support they required.",
              "audioStart": 257.303,
              "audioEnd": 261.079
            },
            {
              "text": "Her heart remained just as nice as it had been when she owned nothing.",
              "audioStart": 261.941,
              "audioEnd": 265.066
            },
            {
              "text": "She never forgot the hard days when she walked the roads without a coat.",
              "audioStart": 265.928,
              "audioEnd": 269.416
            },
            {
              "text": "Instead, those memories made her even more giving toward people in need.",
              "audioStart": 270.279,
              "audioEnd": 273.991
            },
            {
              "text": "Years passed by, but her reputation for doing good never faded away.",
              "audioStart": 274.853,
              "audioEnd": 278.716
            },
            {
              "text": "When she finally reached old age, she looked back at her life with total satisfaction.",
              "audioStart": 279.579,
              "audioEnd": 284.216
            },
            {
              "text": "She knew that her choices had made the world a much better place for everyone.",
              "audioStart": 285.079,
              "audioEnd": 288.766
            },
            {
              "text": "Her story was told from generation to generation as a wonderful example of love.",
              "audioStart": 289.628,
              "audioEnd": 294.053
            }
          ]
        }
